# docs/assets/.gitkeep
#
# This file exists solely to make Git track the docs/assets/ directory.
# It contains no content and can be safely ignored.
#
# TO ADD A LOGO:
#   1. Place your logo file at:  docs/assets/logo.png
#   2. In mkdocs.yml, uncomment the two lines:
#        logo: assets/logo.png
#        favicon: assets/logo.png
#   3. Recommended dimensions: 512×512 px, PNG with transparent background.
#      A square SVG also works — rename it to logo.svg and update mkdocs.yml.
